  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvioletmoon.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm0.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://patreon.com/vazkii\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm1.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/vazkiimods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm2.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/vm3.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/hero/gog.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>關於</h1>\n<p><strong>Garden of Glass</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> 的附加模組，新增了天空島模式。Garden of Glass 實作了全新的天空島機制與世界類型（如上所示），並確保所有內容皆可透過可再生的方式取得。</p>\n<p>此模組的 jar 檔本質上僅是一個資料包，同時支援 Forge 與 Fabric/Quilt。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/support.png\" alt=\"\">\n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/vazkii\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/patreon.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.vazkii.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/store.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvioletmoon.org%252fcreeperhost\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://violetmoon.org/branding/ch.png\" alt=\"\"></a>- -</p>",
